"AFFIDAVIT  OF  GLENN  DENNIS 


(1)  My  name  is  Glenn  Dennis 

(2)  My  address  is:  XXXXXXXXXX 

(3)  I am  ( ) employed  as: ( ) retired, 

(4)  In  July  1947,  I was  a mortician,  working  for  the  Ballard  Funeral  Home  in  Roswell,  which 
