• The  magnetic  compass  aided  navigation,  first  reaching  Europe  some  time  in  the  late 
1 2th  century. 

• Eyeglasses  were  invented  in  Italy  in  the  late  1280s. 

• The  astrolabe  returned  to  Europe  via  Islamic  Spain. 

